","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" ends up as after "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" runs. Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" when no\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" is used."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UseQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = Accessor<QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/types.ts:88](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/types.ts#L88)\n\nThe accessor `useQuery` expects as its first argument — Solid re-evaluates it reactively, so `queryKey` and\nother options can depend on signals.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your `queryFn` resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs. Defaults to `TQueryFnData` when no\n`select` is used.\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\nThe type of your `queryKey`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UseQueryOptions\ntitle: UseQueryOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UseQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = Accessor<QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/types.ts:88](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/types.ts#L88)\n\nThe accessor `useQuery` expects as its first argument — Solid re-evaluates it reactively, so `queryKey` and\nother options can depend on signals.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your `queryFn` resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs. Defaults to `TQueryFnData` when no\n`select` is used.\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\nThe type of your `queryKey`.\n"}
